[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0010","text":"啊呜……肚子，好饿……\n那个……便利店，可以去吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0020","text":"嗯、嗯……！／可、可以哦……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0030","text":"……？\n咦……不行吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0040","text":"不是那样啦……！\n……甜花酱……冬天的便利店……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0050","text":"诱惑……太多了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0060","text":"松软软的包子，\n热腾腾的关东煮……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0070","text":"不知不觉，手就伸过去了呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0071","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0080","text":"欢迎光临！目前\n包子和关东煮正在打折促销中！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0090","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_03_0100","text":"冬、冬天的诱惑……"}]
